to pass the AccordionItem value to the header.\n */\nprivate val LocalAccordionItemValue = compositionLocalOf<String> {\n error(\"No AccordionItem value provided\")\n}"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","name":"edit_file","tool_call_id":"toolu_bdrk_015Eu1x3Bvm3q57t359KJd29","content":"The apply model made the following changes to the file:

