The issue is now fixed. I replaced the problematic code that was trying to directly access composition details with a proper Compose pattern using CompositionLocal:

1. Added a new `LocalCurrentAccordionItemValue` composition local to pass the item value
2. Modified the `AccordionItem` component to provide this value through `CompositionLocalProvider`
3. Simplified the `AccordionHeader` component to consume this value directly
4. Fixed the demo code to use the correct parameters

